        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-rows-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="Center">[　]<br/>병역판정검사<br/>ㆍ입영판정검사<br/>ㆍ재병역판정<br/>검사일 연기</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p text:style-name="P9">병역판정검사ㆍ입영판정검사ㆍ재병역판정검사일<br/>　년　　월　　일</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="P9">연기 후 희망일<br/>　년　　월　　일</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p text:style-name="P9">연기 사유</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      </table:table>
